// Propel — Event Flow: user.registered
// Type: Flow Chart
// Full lifecycle of the user.registered event from registration to welcome email

User [icon: user, color: blue]
API Gateway [icon: shield, color: yellow]
Keycloak [icon: lock, color: red]

user.registered [icon: message-circle, color: orange] {
  Topic user.registered
  Payload userId email username
  Publisher API Gateway
  Consumer Notification Service
}

Notification Service [icon: bell, color: red]
Welcome Email [icon: mail, color: green]

User > API Gateway: POST register
API Gateway > Keycloak: create user via admin API
Keycloak > API Gateway: user created
API Gateway > user.registered: publish event
user.registered > Notification Service: consume
Notification Service > Welcome Email: send welcome email
Notification Service > API Gateway: ack
API Gateway > User: 201 Created